| --- | ---: | --- |
| [account-authorisation](account-authorisation/README.md) | 1 | The account owner approved this exact payload. |
| [login-link](login-link/README.md) | 2 | A challenge-bound login, or explicitly accepted bearer evidence, links an identity. |
| [attribute-gating](attribute-gating/README.md) | 2 | A credential with attribute A was presented; a fixed effect happens. |
| [uniqueness](uniqueness/README.md) | 1 | This person has not done this in this app before; a fixed effect happens. |
| [payment-settlement](payment-settlement/README.md) | 1 | A payment matching this order happened; the order's fixed effect happens once. |
| [event-proof](event-proof/README.md) | 1 | This external event happened; a fixed effect happens once per event. |
